br><br>Experienced players can discover and master the nuanced elements to the combat. For example, there are many ways to deal with the boomerang blades thrown by the Adleraki (bird-people) of level 1:<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117920/extras/c128c623447e47f07b2dc571ef8bc861.poster.avif?t=1737713850\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117920/extras/c128c623447e47f07b2dc571ef8bc861.webm?t=1737713850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117920/extras/c128c623447e47f07b2dc571ef8bc861.mp4?t=1737713850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>While taking place in a epic fantasy world, the intriguing plot unfolds fluidly during the action and level transitions. Like the classic arcade style games of the past, DaemonClaw is intended to be an adrenalin fueled blast. There's no grinding for experience points or health potions in DaemonClaw and no back-tracking to find additional items. Bosses become easier to beat as you build your actual skill playing the game. DaemonClaw is a continual fast action push towards the goal of ending a sudden war and saving humanity. The goal of the game design of DaemonClaw is non-stop fun and great replay value as a result. The kind of game you'll want to play again even though you just beat it earlier that same day.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117920/extras/e6dd7ddf48dddc42b7011f9d7d928e3b.avif?t=1737713850\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117920/extras/f1f4121f1b3fc9e76254240ea116804d.poster.avif?t=1737713850\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117920/extras/f1f4121f1b3fc9e76254240ea116804d.gif?t=1737713850\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117920/extras/bdd8e6a94f6aac53d030f4572db4a51d.poster.avif?t=1737713850\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117920/extras/bdd8e6a94f6aac53d030f4572db4a51d.apng?t=1737713850\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117920/extras/c479b267733daad529b43343f217cd39.avif?t=1737713850\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117920/extras/b74ade3705d5dc95b3ce0f24230f0130.poster.avif?t=1737713850\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117920/extras/b74ade3705d5dc95b3ce0f24230f0130.webm?t=1737713850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117920/extras/b74ade3705d5dc95b3ce0f24230f0130.mp4?t=1737713850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117920/extras/0f1de79e75e7133468d5be36f8eb2cc3.poster.avif?t=1737713850\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117920/extras/0f1de79e75e7133468d5be36f8eb2cc3.webm?t=1737713850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117920/extras/0f1de79e75e7133468d5be36f8eb2cc3.mp4?t=1737713850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117920/extras/d1206d3e92ee1fbe57a2983f2b2b2b39.poster.avif?t=1737713850\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117920/extras/d1206d3e92ee1fbe57a2983f2b2b2b39.webm?t=1737713850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117920/extras/d1206d3e92ee1fbe57a2983f2b2b2b39.mp4?t=1737713850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117920/extras/95ef8e6fd2908c52fa36833413787526.avif?t=1737713850\" /></div><br><br>These is the first two bosses you'll encounter in DaemonClaw. You'll have to face many others during your quest.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117920/extras/f7b820fcb62345c171782fa76b47fcc7.avif?t=1737713850\" /></div><br><br>While each level constantly keeps you on your toes with a never ending onslaught of basic enemies, the end of each level is where you'll face off with the most formidable leader of that land, and to make maters worse, they each control powerful magical artifacts, or, in some cases, maybe the artifact controls them...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117920/extras/3861b85373277b06dbdd867f73d02f36.poster.avif?t=1737713850\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117920/extras/3861b85373277b06dbdd867f73d02f36.webm?t=1737713850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1117920/extras/3861b85373277b06dbdd867f73d02f36.mp4?t=1737713850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
